static lstr L3551 = {0, 5, "E0291"};
static lstr L3552 = {0, 264, "`yield` and `yield*` work only directly in a `function*` body, not inside an arrow function or a block expression. `yield*` takes a generator with the same element type.\012Fix: move the `yield` into the generator body, or pass `yield*` a generator of the right type."};
